{"resourceIdentifier":"3984","resourceName":"Leyuan ANIMAL Husbandry Weixian Co., Ltd. NO. 4 Pasture Wastes Recycling Project","description":"Leyuan ANIMAL Husbandry Weixian Co., Ltd. NO. 4 Pasture Wastes Recycling Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) locates in Xiwang Village, Houguan Town, Weixian District, Xingtai City, Hebei Province, P.R China. The project is to build a centralized anaerobic animal manure treatment system which collects manure waste (dairy cow) from Leyuan ANIMAL Husbandry Weixian Co., Ltd. NO. 4 Pasture in Weixian district. The project uses animal manure waste as ferment material to produce biogas in the Completely Stirred Tank Reactor (CSTR) type anaerobic digesters. The recovered biogas will be used for electricity generation at the project site. The electricity generated by the project will be delivered to North China Power Grid (NCPG). The residual waste from the CSTR digesters will be used to produce organic fertilizer at the project site.\r\nThe project is expected to avoid GHG emission of methane through recovery and destruction of biogas. In addition, the electricity generated from the biogas will be delivered to NCPG to replace equivalent electricity generated by the fossil fuel fired power plants connected to the grid.","location":{"latitude":37.132936,"longitude":115.438955},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-12-19","endExclusive":"2023-01-19","endInclusive":"2023-01-18"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3984"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Heibei"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hebei Zhonghai Huaneng Energy Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Hebei Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"3542346576@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"57220"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"China Classification Society Certification Company (CCSC)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"22/12/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 21/03/2021 - 20/03/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=79735&IDKEY=lq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfh9109954565","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"01-Weixian_VCS_PD Listing.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-11-30T15:04:06.76Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=79737&IDKEY=fiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfe109957323","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"03-Weixian_VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-11-30T15:05:03.527Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=104592&IDKEY=f097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn879144232368","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PD_MR_3984_21MAR2021_30SEPT2022.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-12-22T14:44:08.173Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=86323&IDKEY=s8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0n119039417","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"08-Weixian_vcs-registration-representation-single-representor-v4.2-final.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-03-13T08:33:59.283Z"},{"u